;    1: TDecorate(count=17, unk2=65535, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    2: TDecorate(count=4, unk2=16755455, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    3: TDecorate(count=750, unk2=2960895, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    4: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=5265653, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    5: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=8388863, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    6: TDecorate(count=1022, unk2=11271932, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    7: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=おっくう, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    8: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=かな, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;    9: TDecorate(count=2, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=ごうおん, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
;   10: TDecorate(count=1, unk2=4294967295, unk3=4294967295, unk4=0, unk5=1, unk6=0, unk7=4294967295, unk8=, ruby=はば, unk10=4294967295, unk11=4294967295)
; Display conditions:
;    0: TWdCondition(count=4057, target=)
; Links:
;    0: TWdLink(count=3599, event=, unk3=)
;---------------------------------------
; BEGIN DECOMPILED SCRIPT
;---------------------------------------
<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\Code_of_Honor_#2.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\バース\伊勢運転.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>Dinner at Zahha over, we said goodbye to <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="2">Kogori-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
And I get into <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san's</STYLE> car again.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Now we head to Motoki Station, and I go back to the Arata settlement.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="4">Daddy</STYLE> and <STYLE ID="5">Mommy</STYLE> are supposed to come back in the fall too.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, that was fun, wasn't it!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah... I'm sure YOU two had fun."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Was it boring?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I... was made a stepping stone for your amusement..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Ehh? But </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I think that kind of character suits you better, don't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"What do you take me for..."</STYLE><PG>
About 10 more minutes to Motoki Station, maybe.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The road is a little congested.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
With the August heat wave, the car windows are shut tight, and only the sound of the car's air conditioner reaches my ears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Our conversation, too, goes no further after that.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hm?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm going home..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I'm going home already, okay?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Won't you be lonely?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Of course I'll be lonely..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"You'll be lonely, and you're still just going to let me go home like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">Your</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> place to belong is the Arata settlement, isn't it?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Do you seriously think that?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Do you really think that's my only place to belong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm driving. Be quiet."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The light turns green, and the car creeps forward.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The car creeps forward.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It creeps forward, and yet―
{PAUSE ""}
sooner or later it will reach the station.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, where's YOUR place to belong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, do you have a place to belong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Once you're an adult, that kind of thing works itself out."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Can't I... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Can't I... be your place to belong?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, not this again..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I've never once said it as a joke..."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"First off, your own place to belong..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I DO have a place to belong!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　My place to belong... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">is in Motoki-cho too..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At my plea, <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> is silent.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even so, wanting somehow to hear something from <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>, I search through all sorts of memories.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, you called me by my name once, didn't you?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"When I was in the park, about to stab a knife into my own throat. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That time, I heard a voice calling my name."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Thanks to that, I didn't die. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If it weren't for that voice, then before you found me, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, the knife..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Because back then, the only one in Motoki-cho who knew my name was you, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"It must've been your imagination."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"I see. So it was my imagination after all... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">But even if it was my imagination, I'm grateful to that voice."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"We're almost there."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
Now I'm sure of it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That time, <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> shouted my name and searched me out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Looking at <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> now, there's no doubt.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "SE" "3000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車エンジン切る.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\駅前.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> seems to be parking on the shoulder by the station roundabout.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He never parks like this, but today it's as if to say 'who cares about illegal parking.'<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"I'll see you off properly, until the train leaves."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Yeah..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My feet have never been this heavy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Swinging them out of the car is such a <STYLE ID="7" RUBY="おっくう">chore</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
No―I don't want to swing them out.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\車ドア開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\駅ホーム.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "WAIT"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\元木駅.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, come to think of it, there's something I wanted to ask..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"What...?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Why did you bring a knife, of all things, when you left the Arata settlement?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hunting..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I was going to go hunting."</STYLE><PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hunting... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">what?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I mean... until last year, I thought animals were just everywhere, so... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">I figured I'd live off the land by hunting."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"Pff!</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">　Pff-ff-ff-ff...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPN>Ise-san</STYLE> may smile, but he rarely laughs out loud.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
My sheltered-girl story must have been really funny to him.<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Geez, looking back now, it's so embarrassing..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{QUAKE "メッセージボックス土台" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "15" "0" "30"}
<STYLE ID="3"><TXSPS>"Hng-hng-hng...! Dff-ff-ff-ff-ff...!"</STYLE>
{QUAKESTOP "500"}
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<TXSPN>And once <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> starts laughing out loud, he can't stop for a while.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
He tries hard to keep his voice down, but it comes out as a weird laugh, and people who don't know him take him for a pervert, apparently.<PG>
Embarrassing story or not, it makes me happy when <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> laughs.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Normally it would make me happy, but―
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{PAUSE ""}
today is different.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I don't want to waste time on something like this.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\軽くぶつかる.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{QUAKE "人物1" "QUAKE" "1" "15" "0" "0" "30"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\バース\伊勢うつむくバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "200" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{QUAKESTOP "2000"}
I punched <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> in the solar plexus as hard as I could.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Ugh...!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Code_of_Honor.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
<STYLE ID="6">"In 1 more minute I'll be gone...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Are you going to keep acting like that the whole time!?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even if I have to force it, I'll bring <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> back to his senses.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
For just 1 more minute, at least... 
{PAUSE ""}
look at me...!<PG>
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="6">is it because I'm still only 16... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">that you won't look at me?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Or is it nothing to do with age, and I'm just..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢考えるバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<STYLE ID="3">"I'm at a loss here..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"In the end, you never once called me by my name..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―The express train bound for Megasawa will be arriving shortly.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
It seems my train is arriving.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In the end, my place to belong... 
{PAUSE ""}
It's not enough for me to think it's where I belong.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The one who'd be my place to belong has to accept it...<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"Hey, when we were leaving Zahha, </STYLE><STYLE ID="1">Goto-chan</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> handed me this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">You</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> were supposed to get it, and look at it once you're on the train, she said."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\紙ペラ.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\封筒.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I take an envelope from <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Wanting me to look once I'm on the train... maybe that means so <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> won't see it.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But right now, more than that...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Sorry, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">. It was always just me getting carried away. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">From now on too, keep working hard at the healthy development of young people, okay!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"............"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I meant to give <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> the best smile I could.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> looks somehow gloomy.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even at a time like this... why...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―The train will be arriving shortly. Please stand back behind the white line.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"What's with you... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Is that what grown-ups are like?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Make it clear...!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Make it clear! You're a man, aren't you!?</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　If you're turning me down, then turn me down clearly!</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">　Otherwise... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">my place to belong... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">will be left hanging forever..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I wanted to part with a smile at the end.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But it seems that's not <STYLE ID="8" RUBY="かな">to be</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even once the train arrives and leaves, my tears won't dry.<PG>
Do I have to make this kind of decision all by myself too?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Have I been asking too much of <STYLE ID="3">the other person</STYLE> to decide?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But still... that much, I want him to decide.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I want <STYLE ID="3">the man</STYLE>... to decide.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That much, I can be allowed to lean on him, can't I...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車停止.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
The train <STYLE ID="9" RUBY="ごうおん">thunders</STYLE> into the platform.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A hot summer wind blows through between us.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Even that hot wind doesn't dry my tears.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It won't dry them, and it won't wipe them away either.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"I have one favor to ask."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―The doors are opening.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"When </STYLE><STYLE ID="6">your</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> parents come back, tell them this. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">That 2 years from now, a warped police officer like me will come to the Arata settlement."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車ドア.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "SE2" "CLICK"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"That that police officer will come to the Arata settlement not as a police officer, but as one man."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"Will that person come in 2 years?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah. Exactly 2 years from now, on August 1."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"That's exactly my 18th birthday. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Okay, I'll tell them."</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "111" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Does that person... like just any pretty girl?"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "111" "$000000" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "100" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
―The express train bound for Megasawa is now departing.<PG>
<STYLE ID="3">"The one that guy loves is surely―</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">no, without a doubt, just one person. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="3">Someone special, who can each be the other's place to belong."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"I can believe in that person, right?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Yeah."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"But... </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">that person doesn't seem to know my name. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">He's never once called me by my name. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">If he called my name even once... I could believe him. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">That person's voice calling me saved my life. </STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">So if that person called my name―"</STYLE><PG>
―The doors are closing.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000,111,人物1" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE" "0" "PASS"}
{STOPSND "SE2" "0" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車ドア.ogg" "SE2" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "SE2" "CLICK"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\電車発進.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "5000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "5000" "PASS"}
{PLAYSND "環境音\電車進行中.ogg" "SE" "REPEAT" "0" "0"}
{CHGVOL "SE" "1000" "3000" "PASS"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\電車ボックス席.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
The doors close and cut in between me and <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>, and with no time even to look at each other, the train pulls away.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
It took less than a minute for the platform to fall behind and the view to change to deep mountains.<PG>
Just now, <STYLE ID="10" RUBY="はば">blocked</STYLE> by the noise around us, I couldn't hear the last thing <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> said.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But I saw <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san's</STYLE> lips move clearly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I could tell those lips were saying a very short word―a two-syllable word.<PG>
And though I couldn't hear it, he definitely put it into his voice.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> said it properly.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Said it clearly―
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="6">Kana</STYLE>.<PG>
{PLAYSND "最後の声・真呪殺\Code_of_Honor高い.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{STOPSND "SE" "5000" "PASS"}
Honestly, he could've just said it from the start.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If he meant to come in 2 years, there was no need to drag it out this far.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Could it be this was <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san's</STYLE> idea of drama?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
That doesn't suit you at all, <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Or were you nervous in front of a pretty girl?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Honestly, such a lolicon...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\封筒.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
In my hand was the envelope that <STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> had apparently handed over.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
When I opened it, what looked like a photo came out.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This photo is...<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\ザッハ中思い出.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "人物2" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\真呪殺\夏菜中学手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "L" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="6">"Hey, </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE><STYLE ID="6">, I'm 16!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">"Wh-what is it... I know that..."</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="6">"16 is old enough to get married!"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\伊勢驚きバストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"W-w-wait, hold on, hold on, please!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\詫言編　夢から\電車ボックス席.gal" "NORMAL" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{DELETECG "人物1,人物2" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
It's the photo from just now.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
I see―<STYLE ID="1">Goto-san</STYLE> secretly took it, and slipped out partway through to get it developed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
On the back of the photo, it says 'Be happy!'
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Why she gave me a photo like this―
{PAUSE ""}
I know the reason.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\バース\フォトスタンド.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "600" "C" "100" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
I take out the photo frame <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE> gave me.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The photo worthy of this frame is in my hand.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To break free of the fate I've had until now, I'll fill this frame with new memories.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This photo is the first page of my new memories.<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{MESON "500"}
2 more years―
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
In 2 years I'll become an even better woman, just you watch.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A woman good enough for you, <STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>, past the point where you can hide behind embarrassment.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Then be my place to belong, okay?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="3">Ise-san</STYLE>... 
{PAUSE ""}
I love you!
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
<PG>
{}
